---
title: How to Download a Quotation?
sidebar:
  order: 7
---
**To duplicate a quotation:**

1. **Go to the “Quotations” section:**

   - **On the left sidebar, click on “Quotations” to view the list of quotations.**

1. **Select the quotation to download:**

   - **Find the quotation you wish to download from the list.**
   - **Click the ellipsis menu (…) next to the quotation.**

1. **Download the quotation:**

   - **In the dropdown menu, click on “Download Quotation.”.**
   - **A duplicate of the selected quotation will be created, and you can then edit or send the duplicated quotation as needed.**

**Alternatively, you can also access the “Download Quotation” option within the quotation details page under the “Save Quotation” dropdown.**
